      "writtenOn": "2021-05-26T18:36:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m fine with adding canary modules of various types to TEST_MAPPING in Soong, as long as they are not flaky.  SdkExtensions may not be special, but it exercises some paths in Soong that are clearly under tested.",
      "parentUuid": "25487d36_ec9587ca",
      "revId": "f30031661497695c3d7b67ebca7c73ae6e8aedf0",
