      "writtenOn": "2021-05-26T18:40:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because the vast majority of changes to Soong will not affect sdk extensions so running the sdk extension tests will just be a waste of time. Changes to Soong already trigger a large number (\u003e 100) build/tests across a range of branches and configuration.",
      "parentUuid": "25487d36_ec9587ca",
      "revId": "f30031661497695c3d7b67ebca7c73ae6e8aedf0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
